("1Password/arboard", "cargo", "Cross-platform clipboard access (text and images) for Rust, with Wayland support behind a feature flag.", "Copy/paste from a Rust program on Linux (X11/Wayland), macOS and Windows.", "A Wayland-only tool that needs MIME-type control (wl-clipboard-rs).", ["wl-clipboard-rs", "copypasta"], "cargo add arboard --features wayland-data-control"),
